<div class="modal fade" id="modal-idigbio-recordset-not-match" tabindex="-1" role="dialog" aria-labelledby="modal-label" aria-hidden="true">
  <div class="modal-dialog" role="document">
    <div class="modal-content">
      <div class="modal-header">
        <h5 class="modal-title" id="modal-label">Recordset ID not matched
        <button type="button" class="close" data-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close">
          <span aria-hidden="true">&times;</span>
        </button>
        </h5>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-body">
        <p>The organization has a recordset ID and it is different from the iDigBio-supplied ID.</p>
        <ul id="idb-records">
        </ul>
        <p>If you click Save, the specimen will still be saved, but the specimen will not be updated to match the iDigBio record.  You can also click Cancel and return to the edit page.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modal-footer">
        <button id="btn-save" type="button" class="btn btn-primary">Save</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-dismiss="modal">Cancel</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
